{"title": "Harrowing Presence", "pageid": 31997, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Harrowing_Presence", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Harrowing Presence</b> is a passive feature that breaks the spirit of nearby creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<ul><li>Mortal will frays and breaks around this powerful spirit. Creatures within 10 m (33 ft) are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harrowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Harrowed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Harrowed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Harrowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Harrowed (Condition)\">Harrowed</a>.</li>\n<li>Undead creatures ignore this effect.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_a_Lost_Love\" title=\"Echo of a Lost Love\">Echo of a Lost Love</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Non-undead creatures within 10 m (33 ft) are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harrowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Harrowed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Harrowed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Necrotic_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Harrowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Harrowed (Condition)\">Harrowed</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715162047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 990/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6156/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2958/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 160/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643668/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.058      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.058      1 -total\n 44.70%   16.566      2 Template:Cond\n 28.34%   10.503      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 27.08%   10.034      2 Template:Ic